": "884851348037068", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_884851351370401_2053651397418656330_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=j0Ea06rWy2EQ7kNvwHhLiG_&_nc_oc=AdqF3kZiJ1DobGJsEx4xEvZJCyq8Z7Ph11WRanThFs2yXjw7KYTRDy7BIPJhe1m5SkU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK_meXy8WVWJghfOiRj4fRfoK_NR6GhHb_--Z-9iID-Uw&oe=6AB693FC"}, {"file_name": "ChatGPT Image Jul 24, 2026, 04_35_42 PM (2).png", "id": "1356599465962370", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310667_1356599469295703_1536752784403259204_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y1p9lStzNKgQ7kNvwHT_OR9&_nc_oc=AdqkcTROzGtpE7FaMGRPPp5IGn2SNi3ZfDGDlPIj_aAdJ4OfEpjtMGF9VZ5i5IucpWk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIBzG0SrMr9S9ABkbAAhLEE1yxgh550UdNdWAJcyrq2hg&oe=6AB678BB"}, {"file_name": "ChatGPT Image Jul 24, 2026, 04_35_43 PM (5).png", "id": "1268252718585921", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1268252721919254_4762335788711129086_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mfsHZn-VY8QQ7kNvwEAveiY&_nc_oc=Adq8f25-n3cfcZJEVRL-IHJLY_PJMS1msj5o_G8FFDSHwFTAcE7SPHw_eno4Zarhujg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIsCAJ9NeHbmX4183nFKF9j4lFk4XHhclFf1muWTMfCFA&oe=6AB683FC"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ChatGPT Image Jul 24, 2026, 04_45_36 PM (3).png", "id": "1372017194812133", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308699_1372017198145466_6547199046098345184_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ihp8O6b_BQQQ7kNvwH_FP_j&_nc_oc=AdrHiB77t42niUNGcYu1KUVdvbYpABYAulIgTjXu0liV_QF0AgRDq36yFRWYOpYS_AA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJUplE-dzmL109W5j3QirOOdSZ9_OnPDHaYtUbeNYjAFQ&oe=6AB66892"}, "display_name": "Dream Canvas VR: Drawing Studio", "keywords": ["VRdrawing", "VRpainting", "virtualArtStudio", "DrawingSimulation"], "long_description": "Escape into a peaceful forest art studio where your imagination takes center stage. Dream Canvas VR: Drawing Studio turns a blank canvas into a relaxing, hands-on creative space built for Meta Quest.\n\nPick up four colorful markers using natural motion-controller interaction. Your strokes respond to how close the marker tip is pressed to the canvas, giving every line a more expressive feel. Made a mistake or want to reshape an idea? Use your free virtual hand to erase directly on the canvas. You can also grab and reposition the easel and stool to arrange the studio around you.\n\nKeep every creation close. Press the physical Save and Open Saves controls with your controller-driven fingertips, browse an on-canvas gallery with thumbnail previews, and reopen any saved drawing to continue working. Save changes to the original or create a new version, delete saves you no longer need, and export your artwork as a PNG image to your Quest Gallery.\n\nThere are no scores, timers, enemies, or complicated objectives. Dream Canvas VR is a casual VR drawing and painting experience designed for quiet creativity, experimentation, and self-expression. Settle into the natural surroundings, choose a marker, and let the canvas become whatever you imagine.", "short_description": "Relax in a peaceful forest art studio and bring your ideas to life in VR. \n\nPick up four colorful markers with your motion controllers, create pressure-responsive strokes, and erase with your free virtual hand. \n\nMove the easel and stool, save editable drawings, browse thumbnail previews, reopen your work, and export finished art as PNG images to your Quest Gallery. \n\nNo scores or timers\u2014just a canvas and your imagination."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://faizanbashirarain.github.io/caffeinestudios/dream-canvas-vr-drawing-studio-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Caffeine Studios", "support